## 裁决（修正版）

```text
B1-mechanism:        CONFIRMED
B1-seed-robustness:  NOT CONFIRMED
```

- 严格事实：**只有 s42 五条件全过**（s44 Valid 96.88 < 97；s43 67.0）。
- E2E 修正后 C2_s42 headline 全部保持：Valid 98.29 / OpSeq 95.88 / SkillF1-E2E 0.9643 /
  EA-R-E2E 96.77 / CondR-E2E 98.24 / unsup 0.46%。
- C0T 措辞：controlled evidence（同子集/同 epoch/同 seed/同 QLoRA、仅条件化不同、
  post-hoc 单 seed）——"CapabilityIR conditioning, rather than the tool-use subset
  alone, drives the improvement"，不写跨 seed 因果普遍性。
- s43 的 CondR-E2E 从 97.87 修正为 66.78（A1 bug 确如审稿人所料）；
  SkillF1 从 0.988（|Valid）修正解读为 E2E 0.7725。

## s43 Validator Failure Taxonomy（A5）

| 错误码 | s42 | s43 | s44 |
|---|---:|---:|---:|
| STRUCT | 0 | **373** | 0 |
| UNDEFINED_REF | 2 | **287** | 1 |
| ARITY | 1 | **168** | 0 |
| TYPE_MISMATCH | 6 | 83 | 20 |
| OUTPUT | 0 | 3 | 1 |
| **合计** | 9 | **914** | 22 |

**s43 是一种集中性结构失败**（结构畸形 + 未定义引用 + 参数数量，占 90%+），
不是弥散性漂移；对照 s42/s44 全部错误仅 9/22 个。允许的措辞：
"seed-specific structural invalidity despite similar training loss (0.15)"。
根因（如特定 token 化病态）留待结构稳定化工作。

## 冻结 headline 与双句结论

```text
C2-s42: Valid-E2E 98.29 / OpSeq-E2E 95.88 / SkillF1-E2E 0.9643 /
        EXEC_ACTION-R-E2E 96.77 / CondR-E2E 98.24 / unsup-vs-ref 0.46%
```

> **Canonical capability semantics were not missing from the model; they were
> missing from the training interface. Once the TaskIR Composer was explicitly
> trained to consume selected CapabilityIR, semantic controllability was restored.**

> **This controllability is semantically strong but structurally seed-sensitive,
> motivating explicit structural stabilization in later work.**
